,"parts":[{"text":"பரதவர்","lemma":"பரதவர்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"கொண்மீன்","parts":[{"text":"கொண்மீன்","lemma":"கொண்மீன்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"உணங்கல்","parts":[{"text":"உணங்கல்","lemma":"உணங்கல்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true},{"words":[{"surface":"அருங்கழி","parts":[{"text":"அருங்கழி","lemma":"அருங்கழி","gloss":"rare backwater"}],"gloss":"rare backwater","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"கொண்ட","parts":[{"text":"கொண்ட","lemma":"கொள்","gloss":"obtained"}],"gloss":"obtained"},{"surface":"இறவின்","parts":[{"text":"இறவு","lemma":"இறால்","gloss":"prawn"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"இன்","gloss":"of"}],"gloss":"of prawn"},{"surface":"வாடலொடு","parts":[{"text":"வாடல்","lemma":"வாடல்","gloss":"dried state"},{"text":"ஒடு","lemma":"ஒடு","gloss":"with"}],"gloss":"with the dried state"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நிலவுநிறம்","parts":[{"text":"நிலவு","lemma":"நிலவு","gloss":"moonlight"},{"text":"நிறம்","lemma":"நிறம்","gloss":"color"}],"gloss":"moonlight-colored"},{"surface":"வெண்மணல்","parts":[{"text":"வெண்மணல்","lemma":"வெண்மணல்","gloss":"white sand"}],"gloss":"white sand","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"புலவ","parts":[{"text":"புலவ","lemma":"புலவு","gloss":"to smell of fish"}],"gloss":"to smell of fish"},{"surface":"பலவுடன்","parts":[{"text":"பல","lemma":"பல","gloss":"many"},{"text":"உடன்","lemma":"உடன்","gloss":"together"}],"gloss":"many together"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"எக்கர்தொறும்","parts":[{"text":"எக்கர்","lemma":"எக்கர்","gloss":"sand dune"},{"text":"தொறும்","lemma":"தொறும்","gloss":"every"}],"gloss":"on every sand dune"},{"surface":"பரக்கும்","parts":[{"text":"பரக்கும்","lemma":"பரக்கு","gloss":"spreading"}],"gloss":"spreading"},{"surface":"துறைவனொடு","parts":[{"text":"துறைவன்","lemma":"துறைவன்","gloss":"lord of the coast"},{"text":"ஒடு","lemma":"ஒடு","gloss":"with"}],"gloss":"with the lord of the coast"},{"surface":"ஒருநாள்","parts":[{"text":"ஒரு","lemma":"ஒரு","gloss":"one"},{"text":"நாள்","lemma":"நாள்","gloss":"day"}],"gloss":"one day"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நக்கது","parts":[{"text":"நக்கது","lemma":"நகு","gloss":"laughed"}],"gloss":"that we laughed"},{"surface":"ஓர்","parts":[{"text":"ஓர்","lemma":"ஓர்","gloss":"one"}],"gloss":"a single"},{"surface":"பழியும்","parts":[{"text":"பழி","lemma":"பழி","gloss":"blame"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"even"}],"gloss":"even blame"},{"surface":"இலமே","parts":[{"text":"இலம்","lemma":"இலெம்","gloss":"we do not have"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"we do not have indeed"},{"surface":"போது","parts":[{"text":"போது","lemma":"போது","gloss":"bud"}],"gloss":"bud"},{"surface":"அவிழ்","parts":[{"text":"அவிழ்","lemma":"அவிழ்","gloss":"blooming"}],"gloss":"blooming"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பொன்","parts":[{"text":"பொன்","lemma":"பொன்","gloss":"gold"}],"gloss":"golden"},{"surface":"இணர்","parts":[{"text":"இணர்","lemma":"இணர்","gloss":"flower cluster"}],"gloss":"flower clusters"},{"surface":"மரீஇய","parts":[{"text":"மரீஇய","lemma":"மருவு","gloss":"associated with"}],"gloss":"associated with"},{"surface":"புள்","parts":[{"text":"புள்","lemma":"புள்","gloss":"bird"}],"gloss":"birds"},{"surface":"இமிழ்","parts":[{"text":"இமிழ்","lemma":"இமிழ்","gloss":"chirping"}],"gloss":"chirping"},{"surface":"பொங்கர்","parts":[{"text":"பொங்கர்","lemma":"பொங்கர்","gloss":"grove"}],"gloss":"groves"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"புன்னை","parts":[{"text":"புன்னை","lemma":"புன்னை","gloss":"Punna tree"}],"gloss":"Punna tree"},{"surface":"அம்","parts":[{"text":"அம்","lemma":"அம்","gloss":"beautiful"}],"gloss":"beautiful"},{"surface":"சேரி","parts":[{"text":"சேரி","lemma":"சேரி","gloss":"hamlet"}],"gloss":"hamlet"},{"surface":"இவ்வூர்","parts":[{"text":"இவ்வூர்","lemma":"இவ்வூர்","gloss":"this town"}],"gloss":"this town","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கொன்னலர்","parts":[{"text":"கொன்னலர்","lemma":"கொன்னலர்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"தூற்றந்தன்","parts":[{"text":"தூற்றந்தன்","lemma":"தூற்றந்தன்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"கொடுமை","parts":[{"text":"கொடுமை","lemma":"கொடுமை","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"யானே","parts":[{"text":"யானே","lemma":"யானே","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true}],"literal":"Great ocean fishermen's caught fish drying / with the dried state of prawns caught in the rare backwater, / smelling of fish, together on the moonlight-colored white sand, / spreading on every sand dune, with the lord of the coast, one day, / we did not have even a single blame of having laughed, / in the groves where birds chirp, associated with golden flower clusters of blooming buds, / in this town with the beautiful hamlet of Punna trees, / because of its cruelty of spreading useless gossip!","translation":"We did not share even a single smile with the lord of the coast—whose land spreads the catch of great-ocean fishermen and dried prawns from the deep backwaters to dry together on every dune of moonlight-white sand, making them smell of fish. Yet, this town of beautiful streets lined with Punna trees, where birds chirp in groves rich with golden clusters of blooming buds, cruelly spreads useless gossip about us.","modern":"பெரிய கடல் மீனவர்கள் பிடித்த மீன்களையும், அரிய கழிகளில் பிடித்த இறால்களின் கருவாட்டையும், நிலவின் நிறமுடைய வெண்மணலில் மீன் நாற்றம் வீசுமாறு பலவாகச் சேர்த்து, மணல் மேடுகள் தோறும் காயவைக்கும் கடற்கரைத் தலைவனுடன் ஒருநாள் கூட நாம் சிரித்துப் பேசிய பழியும் நமக்கு இல்லை. ஆனால், அரும்புகள் மலர்ந்து பொன்னிறப் பூங்கொத்துகள் நிறைந்த, பறவைகள் ஒலிக்கும் சோலைகளையும் புன்னை மரங்களையும் உடைய அழகிய தெருக்களைக் கொண்ட இவ்வூர், தன் கொடுமையினால் வீணான அலரைத் தூற்றுகின்றது.","explanation":"The heroine is speaking to her close friend about the unfair rumors spreading in her town. She points out that she has not even shared a single smile or brief moment of laughter with the lord of the coast. Yet, the townspeople have already begun spreading malicious gossip about them. The imagery of fish and prawns laid out to dry on the open, white sand dunes reflects how her private life has been exposed to public scrutiny. The contrast between the beautiful, bird-filled Punna groves and the harshness of the town's gossip highlights her emotional distress.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"}}